1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,705
C, zinc two plus.

2
00:00:01,705 --> 00:00:09,986
It is 3d ten: the d subshell is full, so there is no vacancy in the upper level for an electron to jump into.

3
00:00:09,986 --> 00:00:12,864
No d d transition, no colour.

4
00:00:12,864 --> 00:00:23,567
Copper two plus is 3d nine, iron three plus 3d five, nickel two plus 3d eight: all have partly filled d subshells.

